From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: MANET <manet@localhost>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 12:00:00 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: rockchip: rock-3a: delay PCIe slot power

The PCIe3 PHY polls SRAM_INIT_DONE for 500 us right after the slot rail
is enabled. With no startup delay on vcc3v3_pcie the poll can time out
and the M.2 card on pcie3x2 never probes. Give the rail 50 ms to settle.

---
diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/rk3568-rock-3a.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/rk3568-rock-3a.dts
index 44cfdfeed..f4cedfcdb 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/rk3568-rock-3a.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/rk3568-rock-3a.dts
@@ -127,6 +127,8 @@ vcc3v3_pcie: regulator-vcc3v3-pcie {
 		regulator-min-microvolt = <3300000>;
 		regulator-max-microvolt = <3300000>;
 		vin-supply = <&vcc5v0_sys>;
+		/* the PCIe3 PHY SRAM needs the slot rail settled before its 500 us init poll */
+		startup-delay-us = <50000>;
 	};
 
 	vcc3v3_sys: regulator-vcc3v3-sys {
